# One target card has no order to choose, so none is asked: the Ornithopter goes on top of the library and the draw takes it right back, while the Elvish Mystic stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forever Young
Faithless Looting
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Elvish Mystic
Island
Island x7

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter; Elvish Mystic)
